Certificates issued by scripts/tailscale-cert.sh land here and are mounted
read-only into the Caddy container at /etc/caddy/certs.

Nothing in this directory is committed: a private key in git is a private key
everywhere git has ever been. .gitignore enforces that; this file only keeps the
directory itself present, because compose bind-mounts it and a missing bind
source becomes a root-owned directory rather than an error.
